                                            "imageName":  "WispReservoir.png"
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "name":  "Wil-O-Wisp",
                                            "description":  "Cast forward a spectral image of Wisp to confuse and distract enemies. Reactivate to travel to its position. Hold to have the image travel faster and teleport to its position on release. ",
                                            "uniqueName":  "/Lotus/Powersuits/Wisp/Abilities/WispLightAbility",
                                            "imageName":  "WispLight.png"
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "name":  "Breach Surge",
                                            "description":  "Open a dimensional breach to overwhelm nearby enemies and cause them to release aggressive Surge sparks when damaged.\nWisp may also target a Reservoir to teleport to it and double the range of the surge.",
                                            "uniqueName":  "/Lotus/Powersuits/Wisp/Abilities/WispHarnessAbility",
                                            "imageName":  "WispHarnessTheLight.png"
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "name":  "Sol Gate",
                                            "description":  "Open a portal to the sun to irradiate enemies with a devastating beam of pure solar plasma. Hold fire to double Damage at the cost of increased energy consumption. For the duration of an attack enemies damaged by Sol Gate are increasingly more vulnerable to it.",
                                            "uniqueName":  "/Lotus/Powersuits/Wisp/Abilities/WispSunAbility",
                                            "imageName":  "WispSolGate.png"
                                        }
